ess networks.<h3>Top Features of an ONU:</h3><ul><li><b>High-Speed Data Transmission<br></b>Supports Gigabit-speed internet for seamless streaming, online gaming, cloud computing, and more.</li></ul><ul><li><b>Optical-to-Electrical Signal Conversion</b></li></ul><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Converts incoming fiber-optic signals into electrical Ethernet signals for routers, computers, and other digital devices.</p><ul><li><b>Multiple Interface Options</b></li></ul><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Equipped with Ethernet ports, voice ports (POTS), and sometimes Wi-Fi—perfect for triple-play services (data, voice, video).</p><ul><li><b>Two-Way Communication</b></li></ul><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Enables upstream and downstream data flow, providing stable internet and real-time communication.</p><ul><li><b>Compact &amp; Energy-Efficient Design</b></li></ul><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Low power consumption with a small form factor, ideal for residential and commercial environments.</p><ul><li><b>Easy Integration</b></li></ul><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Seamlessly integrates with OLT (Optical Line Terminal) devices in a Passive Optical Network (PON) architecture.</p>","detailsHtml":"<p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">ONU, FTTx Solution, ,</span></p>","topDesc":"","subcats":[],"products":[{"id":"779","name":"DM (Digital Media) PTF 2251L XPON ONU","href":"/onu/dm-digital-media-ptf-2251l-xpon-onu","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/PTF%202251L/DM%20(Digital%20Media)%20PTF%202251L%20XPON%20ONU%20P2-250x250.jpg.webp","width":250,"height":250},"imageSecond":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/PTF%202251L/DM%20(Digital%20Media)%20PTF%202251L%20XPON%20ONU%20P1-250x250.jpg.webp","width":250,"height":250},"price":"0৳","oldPrice":null,"label":null,"requestPrice":true,"brand":{"name":"DM","href":"/dm"},"model":"PTF 2251L","features":["Model: PTF 2251L","PON Standard: GPON (ITU-T G.984.x) / EPON (IEEE 802.